{"@context":["https://schema.org",{"emsenn":"https://emsenn.net/vocab#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"}],"@id":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2025-03-29-when-power-buys-itself/","@type":"Article","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn"},"dateModified":"2025-03-29","datePublished":"2025-03-29","description":"Yesterday, it was announced that xAI is acquiring X. That sentence is easy to skip past. It sounds like corporate rearranging, maybe a branding pivot, maybe Musk doing Musk things again. But the thing is—X is already owned by Elon Musk. And …","name":"2025-03-29, When power buys itself","publisher":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn","url":"https://emsenn.net"},"url":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2025-03-29-when-power-buys-itself/"}